# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Git on Windows defaults to CRLF in the working tree, which makes diffs noisy
# and embeds CRLF in published tarballs. With `eol=lf` the repository, the
# checked-out files, and `npm pack` output all agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and release artifacts must never be line-ending converted.
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.slx binary
*.mat binary
*.pdf binary

# Generated or vendored content: keep out of diffs and language statistics.
dist/*.tgz binary
dist/*.zip binary
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
